@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/memos/edit.html.erb" as View
control "MemosController" as Controller
entity "Memo Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Edit memo form and submit
View -> Controller: Send PATCH/PUT /memos/:id request
Controller -> Model: Find memo by ID
Model -> DB: Query memo by ID
DB --> Model: Return memo object
Model -> Model: Update memo attributes
Model -> DB: Save updated memo
DB --> Model: Return success/failure
Model --> Controller: Return updated memo object
Controller -> View: Redirect to memos show page
View -> User: Display updated memo
@enduml
